## Post-mix handling

1. Label the bottle with formula ID, concentration, date, exact stock IDs and batch size.
2. Rest closed, dark and cool for at least 72 hours before the first serious blotter assessment.
3. Reassess at day 7 and day 14. Record top, heart, drydown, projection, floral identity, fruit balance, musk cleanliness and any shampoo, laundry, metallic-rose or amberwood failure.
4. Do not scale to 30 mL until the 5 mL pilot has passed the preference and concentration screen.

## Ideal-version note

This make-now recipe deliberately excludes the unavailable ideal-architecture additions: Red Mandarin EO, Ethylene Brassylate and Hedione High Cis. Do not improvise replacements inside this pilot, because doing so would break comparability with the controlled current-inventory build.
